## 🎙️ Voice Commands Reference

Enable voice control from the side panel ("Enable Voice" toggle) or by saying **"enable voice"**.  
Say **"help"** at any time to hear available commands via TTS.

### 🧭 Navigation Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"scroll down"` / `"page down"` | Scroll down ~80% of the viewport |
| `"scroll up"` / `"page up"` | Scroll up ~80% of the viewport |
| `"scroll left"` | Scroll left 300 px |
| `"scroll right"` | Scroll right 300 px |
| `"scroll faster"` | Scroll down 150% of the viewport |
| `"scroll slower"` | Scroll down 30% of the viewport |
| `"stop scrolling"` / `"stop"` | Stop current scroll |
| `"scroll to top"` / `"top"` | Jump to top of page |
| `"scroll to bottom"` / `"bottom"` | Jump to bottom of page |
| `"go back"` / `"back"` | Browser back (`history.back()`) |
| `"go forward"` / `"forward"` | Browser forward (`history.forward()`) |
| `"reload"` / `"refresh"` | Reload page |

### 🖱️ Click Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"click"` | Left-click the focused / hovered element (YouTube & Google-aware) |
| `"double click"` | Double-click current element |
| `"right click"` | Right-click (context menu) current element |
| `"left click"` | Explicit left-click current element |
| `"hover"` | Dispatch mouseenter / mouseover on current element |

### 🗂️ Tab Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"new tab"` | Open a new browser tab |
| `"close tab"` | Close current tab |
| `"next tab"` | Switch to next tab |
| `"previous tab"` / `"prev tab"` | Switch to previous tab |

### 🔍 Zoom Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"zoom in"` | Zoom page in (×1.1) |
| `"zoom out"` | Zoom page out (÷1.1) |
| `"reset zoom"` | Reset zoom to 100% |

### 🖥️ Fullscreen Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"fullscreen"` / `"full screen"` | Toggle fullscreen mode |
| `"exit fullscreen"` | Exit fullscreen mode |

### ✏️ Text & Selection Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"select all"` | Select all text (input-aware) |
| `"copy"` | Copy selected text to clipboard |
| `"paste"` | Paste from clipboard into active field |
| `"cut"` | Cut selected text |
| `"undo"` | Undo last action |
| `"redo"` | Redo last action |
| `"clear text"` / `"clear"` | Clear text in active input/textarea |
| `"delete last word"` | Delete the last word before cursor |

### ⌨️ Text Input / Dictation Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"start typing"` | Focus first input field & enable dictation mode |
| `"stop typing"` | Blur active field & exit dictation mode |
| `"start copy"` | Enable copy mode (select then stop copy) |
| `"stop copy"` | Copy current selection & exit copy mode |
| `"start paste"` | Paste clipboard into active field |
| `"stop paste"` | Exit paste mode |

### ⌨️ Key Press Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"press enter"` / `"enter"` | Dispatch Enter key |
| `"press tab"` / `"tab"` | Dispatch Tab key |
| `"press escape"` / `"escape"` / `"esc"` | Dispatch Escape key |

### 📝 Form Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"next field"` | Move focus to next form field |
| `"previous field"` / `"prev field"` | Move focus to previous form field |
| `"check checkbox"` / `"check box"` | Check focused (or first unchecked) checkbox |
| `"uncheck checkbox"` / `"uncheck box"` | Uncheck focused (or first checked) checkbox |
| `"submit form"` / `"submit"` | Submit the current form |

### 🎬 Media Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"play"` | Play video/audio |
| `"pause"` | Pause video/audio |
| `"mute"` | Mute media |
| `"unmute"` | Unmute media |
| `"volume up"` | Increase volume (+10%) |
| `"volume down"` | Decrease volume (−10%) |
| `"next video"` | Go to next video (YouTube-aware) |
| `"previous video"` / `"prev video"` | Go to previous video |
| `"skip forward"` / `"skip ahead"` | Skip forward 10 seconds |
| `"rewind"` / `"skip back"` | Rewind 10 seconds |

### 📺 YouTube-Specific Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"play video"` | Play YouTube video |
| `"pause video"` | Pause YouTube video |
| `"youtube next"` / `"yt next"` | Next YouTube video |
| `"youtube previous"` / `"yt prev"` | Previous YouTube video |
| `"skip 10 seconds"` / `"skip ten seconds"` | Skip forward 10 s |
| `"rewind 10 seconds"` / `"rewind ten seconds"` | Rewind 10 s |

### ♿ Accessibility Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"read page"` / `"read aloud"` | Read entire page via TTS |
| `"stop reading"` | Stop TTS |
| `"read selected text"` / `"read selection"` | Read highlighted text via TTS |
| `"increase text size"` | Enlarge page text (+10%) |
| `"decrease text size"` | Shrink page text (−10%, min 8 px) |

### 🔧 Extension / BUG Control Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"enable voice"` / `"turn on voice"` | Enable voice recognition |
| `"disable voice"` / `"turn off voice"` | Disable voice recognition |
| `"enable mouth click"` | Enable mouth-click feature |
| `"disable mouth click"` | Disable mouth-click feature |
| `"enable head tracking"` | Enable head-tracking cursor |
| `"disable head tracking"` | Disable head-tracking cursor |
| `"start calibration"` / `"calibrate"` | Launch head-tracking calibration (`Alt+H`) |
| `"reset calibration"` | Clear stored calibration data |

### 🌐 Browser Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"open history"` / `"history"` | Open browser history page |
| `"open downloads"` / `"downloads"` | Open downloads page |
| `"open bookmarks"` / `"bookmarks"` | Open bookmarks page |

### 🔎 Search Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"search <query>"` | Google search for `<query>` in a new tab |
| `"search"` (alone) | TTS asks "What do you want to search?" — speak your query → Google opens |
| `"find <text>"` | Find and highlight text on the current page |

### 🔘 Google Search Result Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"open first result"` / `"first result"` | Click the first Google search result |
| `"open second result"` / `"second result"` | Click the second result |
| `"open third result"` / `"third result"` | Click the third result |

### 💡 Smart / Utility Commands

| Say this | What happens |
|----------|-------------|
| `"yes"` / `"yep"` / `"yeah"` | Click Yes / Confirm button |
| `"no"` / `"nope"` | Click No / Cancel button |
| `"cancel"` | Cancel current action or search prompt |
| `"help"` | TTS reads available commands; full list logged to console |
| `"repeat"` | Repeat last command |

---

## 📝 Recording Test Results

After running the tests above, record your findings in a `TEST_RESULTS_<date>.md` file following the repo guidelines. Include:
- Browser name & version
- Whether the service worker was reloaded during testing
- Pass / Fail for each test ID (T01–T21)
- Console errors or screenshots for any failures

---

## 🔗 Quick Reference — Keyboard Shortcuts

| Shortcut | Action |
|----------|--------|
| `Alt+H` | Start head calibration |
| `Alt+M` | Start mouth calibration |
| `Alt+N` | Toggle head-pointer mode on/off |
| `Alt+P` | Toggle red pointer overlay |
| `Alt+V` | Toggle mirrored camera preview |
| `Shift+H` | Toggle debug HUD |
| `Esc` | Cancel active summary |
